From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:09:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] test(e2e): keep New session on the composer unless testing
 the project picker

The project picker now opens in front of the composer whenever a project
exists, and the shared E2E server accumulates projects across tests. Tests
that click New session and expect the composer or "/" timed out on the
picker. Set omnigent:new-chat-project-prompt=off for those tests (the
common start-session routes helper and the three tests that build their
own routes or use the page fixture), and add a dedicated E2E that leaves
the preference on and drives the picker's No project and project rows.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Docs: none (test-only: e2e setup around the project picker)
---
